(7652615, 1245463, 86218, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment. Fantastic still life. Colours and processing very natural and somehow this comp and image really works. Blue with the Softness of the yellow flower. One of my highest votes. No expert on these shots but the only thing I would try do differently is to get the background more blurred in order to get the textured/pattern material less featured as the material clashes a bit with the smooth glass and soft petals of the flowers. Thats just me</td>', 'Coming back to comment. Fantastic still life. Colours and processing very natural and somehow this comp and image really works. Blue with the Softness of the yellow flower. One of my highest votes. No expert on these shots but the only thing I would try do differently is to get the background more blurred in order to get the textured/pattern material less featured as the material clashes a bit with the smooth glass and soft petals of the flowers. Thats just me', '2020-02-03 11:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652616, 1245224, 86218, '<td valign="top">Whats not to like in this. Sharp. Shallow depth. Great detail and comp is a safe bet with these kind of images. Looking straight in to this horsies soul. 8</td>', 'Whats not to like in this. Sharp. Shallow depth. Great detail and comp is a safe bet with these kind of images. Looking straight in to this horsies soul. 8', '2020-02-03 11:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
